# Semgrep scan exclusions (gitignore syntax).
# Generated or vendored code only — do not add source files here. Pre-existing
# findings in real source are excluded by --baseline-commit on PRs instead.

# Dependencies and build output (normally already gitignored).
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.turbo/
**/coverage/
**/coverage-html/

# Generated client code: machine-written, and regenerating it must not fail CI.
**/src/generated/
**/src/generated-effect/
**/*.gen.ts
**/*.d.ts

# Test and browser artifacts.
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
.playwright-browsers/

# Test fixtures are data, not code.
**/e2e/fixtures/
